abstract: >
  Retrospective audit of high-to-low-load hydrogen-concentration prediction
  in four long-term PEM water electrolysis trajectories. Compares frozen
  mappings, time baselines and causally revealed low-load labels.
  One primary MEA per configuration; no independent experimental validation.
keywords:
  - PEM water electrolysis
  - gas recombination catalyst
  - temporal validation
  - recalibration
  - reproducibility
